  "description": "A sham marriage... or is it?\n\nCarlee Browning, the head of the powerful Brownings, is sick of suitors eyeing her fortune. Her solution? Propose to teenage aristocrat Ethelred Elad! With his family in ruins, this sham marriage would be perfect for both of them, just until they're able to divorce. If they do divorce, that is.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
